name 'iterating-with-ai-postassessment-q6_2025'

question 'Why is it considered a "trust" issue if a data dashboard shows a completely blank screen when no results match a search?'

right 'The user might assume the app is broken or frozen rather than knowing there are simply no matches.'
wrong 'Blank screens use more battery power on mobile devices.'
wrong 'AI tools cannot read blank screens to help the user.'
wrong 'Horizontal scrolling is impossible on a blank screen.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

teacher_markdown <<MARKDOWN
Lesson 4

Transparency builds trust. Showing an "empty state" message (e.g., "0 items found") confirms the app is working and that the user's search was processed correctly.
MARKDOWN
